  "id": "stuffed-crown-roast-of-pork",
  "name": "Stuffed Crown Roast of Pork",
  "subtitle": "A savory pork-and-apple stuffing baked in a festive crown roast.",
  "description": "A seasoned bread stuffing with pork, sausage, apple, celery, onion, and herbs fills a crown roast for a substantial American-style dinner.",
